# =============================================================================
# AEGIS-Cloud — Compliance Audit Trail
# =============================================================================
# File:     mlops/compliance/audit_trail.log
# Format:   NATO-Style Incident Report (structured log)
#
# PURPOSE
# -------
# Immutable, append-only log of all high-risk AI decisions, self-healing
# commands, and Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) approvals/rejections.
#
# This file is the primary artefact for EU AI Act Article 12 (Record-
# Keeping) compliance audits.  Every entry must contain:
#
#   Timestamp (ISO-8601) | Event_Type | Correlation_ID |
#   Classification | Confidence | XAI_Evidence_Ref |
#   Human_Decision | Justification | Lat/Long
#
# EVENT TYPES
# -----------
#   DETECTION       — New target detected by Edge Vision Node
#   CLASSIFICATION  — Threat classification issued by Cloud Evaluator
#   SELF_HEALING    — Motor-speed command issued by Self-Healing Service
#   HITL_APPROVAL   — Human operator approved a Hostile classification
#   HITL_REJECTION  — Human operator rejected a Hostile classification
#   MODEL_UPDATE    — New model version deployed (YOLO or VANGUARD)
#   SYSTEM_ANOMALY  — AIOps health alert triggered
#
# RETENTION POLICY
# ----------------
# Entries must be retained for a minimum of 10 years per EU AI Act
# Article 12 requirements for high-risk AI systems.
#
# --- Log entries below this line ---
